<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Submit a Ticket | WebRite Support</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Need a change, a fix or something new on your website? Submit a WebRite support ticket and get a ticket number by email.">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="32x32">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.png" type="image/png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/apple-touch-icon.png">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    /* ===== Brand settings: change these to match the rest of webrite.net ===== */
    :root {
      --brand: #1f5eff;        /* main brand color (buttons, links, accents) */
      --brand-dark: #1747c4;   /* hover state */
      --ink: #14171f;          /* headings and body text */
      --muted: #5b6272;        /* secondary text */
      --bg: #ffffff;           /* page background */
      --soft: #f4f6fb;         /* light section background */
      --line: #e3e7ef;         /* borders */
      --urgent: #d93025;       /* "site is down" callout */
      --radius: 14px;
      --font: 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: var(--font); color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); line-height: 1.6; }
    a { color: var(--brand); text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { color: var(--brand-dark); }
    .wrap { width: min(1100px, 92%); margin: 0 auto; }

    /* Header */
    header { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; }
    .nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 68px; }
    .logo { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.35rem; color: var(--ink); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    .logo span { color: var(--brand); }
    .nav ul { display: flex; gap: 28px; list-style: none; }
    .nav ul a { color: var(--muted); font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .nav ul a:hover, .nav ul a[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--ink); }
    .menu-btn { display: none; background: none; border: 0; font-size: 1.6rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--ink); }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { background: var(--soft); padding: 64px 0 56px; }
    .eyebrow { display: inline-block; font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--brand); margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 2.9rem); line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.025em; max-width: 16ch; }
    .hero p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.1rem; max-width: 56ch; margin-top: 16px; }

    /* Layout */
    .main { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 320px; gap: 40px; padding: 48px 0 72px; align-items: start; }

    /* Form card */
    .form-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }
    .form-card iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: 1650px; border: 0; }

    /* Sidebar */
    aside { display: grid; gap: 20px; position: sticky; top: 92px; }
    .box { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 22px; background: #fff; }
    .box h2 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .urgent { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--urgent) 35%, white); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--urgent) 5%, white); }
    .urgent h2 { color: var(--urgent); }
    .urgent p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink); }
    .steps { list-style: none; counter-reset: s; display: grid; gap: 14px; }
    .steps li { counter-increment: s; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr; gap: 10px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .steps li::before { content: counter(s); width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--brand); color: #fff;
      font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; display: grid; place-items: center; }
    .steps strong { color: var(--ink); font-weight: 600; }
    .tips { list-style: none; display: grid; gap: 8px; font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .tips li::before { content: "✓"; color: var(--brand); font-weight: 700; margin-right: 8px; }
    .fallback { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--muted); }

    /* Footer */
    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 28px 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
    footer .wrap { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* Mobile */
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .main { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      aside { position: static; order: -1; }
      .form-card iframe { height: 2000px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .menu-btn { display: block; }
      .nav ul { display: none; position: absolute; top: 68px; left: 0; right: 0; flex-direction: column; gap: 0;
        background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .nav ul.open { display: flex; }
      .nav ul a { display: block; padding: 14px 4%; }
      .hero { padding: 44px 0 40px; }
      .form-card iframe { height: 2150px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <nav class="wrap nav" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Web<span>Rite</span></a>
      <button class="menu-btn" aria-label="Menu" aria-expanded="false"
        onclick="const u=this.nextElementSibling;u.classList.toggle('open');this.setAttribute('aria-expanded',u.classList.contains('open'))">☰</button>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a></li>
        <li><a href="/support/" aria-current="page">Support</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Client support</span>
      <h1>Submit a ticket</h1>
      <p>Need a change, a fix or something new on your website? Tell us what you need and you'll get a ticket number by email right away.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="wrap main">
    <div class="form-card">
      <iframe
        src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxcRuatkasClBlGLPufSMuG6bYTqNc0eNqLIEavexOAPBu8w/viewform?embedded=true"
        title="WebRite support ticket form" loading="lazy">Loading…</iframe>
    </div>

    <aside>
      <div class="box urgent">
        <h2>Is your site down?</h2>
        <p>Choose <strong>"Website is down"</strong> and <strong>Urgent</strong> on the form. Urgent tickets alert us immediately and are handled first.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="box">
        <h2>What happens next</h2>
        <ol class="steps">
          <li><span><strong>You get a ticket number</strong> by email within a minute (WR-1001, for example).</span></li>
          <li><span><strong>We review it</strong> and reach out the way you prefer if we have questions.</span></li>
          <li><span><strong>You get an email when it's done.</strong> Reply to it if anything isn't right.</span></li>
        </ol>
      </div>

      <div class="box">
        <h2>Tips for a faster fix</h2>
        <ul class="tips">
          <li>Name the page that needs changing</li>
          <li>Paste the exact new wording</li>
          <li>Share photos or logos as a Drive or Dropbox link</li>
          <li>One request per ticket</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="fallback">Form not loading? <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdxcRuatkasClBlGLPufSMuG6bYTqNc0eNqLIEavexOAPBu8w/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open it in a new tab</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@webrite.net">support@webrite.net</a>.</p>
    </aside>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">
      <span>© <span id="yr"></span> WebRite. Websites that work.</span>
      <a href="mailto:support@webrite.net">support@webrite.net</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>document.getElementById('yr').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>
